# Never commit somebody's photographs. This repository is public and git
# history is permanent. A phone photo carries GPS coordinates, a timestamp and
# a face, and the EXIF parser in this package exists precisely because that
# data is there. Every fixture under tests/fixtures/ is a synthetic image
# generated by scripts/generate-fixtures.ts and verified by hash in CI.
#
# Real photographs used for measurement belong in scratch/, which is ignored.
scratch/
*.private.*
real-*.heic
real-*.HEIC
real-*.png
real-*.jpg
real-*.jpeg
